{"id":"n49497-1-7","stage":2,"title":"당연히 · 当然","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n49497-1-7-1","ko":"엄마, 오늘도 이 닦고 자요?","zh":"妈妈，今天也要刷牙再睡觉吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}},{"text":"오늘도","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘도","audio":"/audio/77d25b815bea9e75c627.mp3"}},{"text":"이","meaning":"牙齿","explanation":"이：牙齿","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69529","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"닦고","meaning":"刷，擦","explanation":"닦다：刷，擦；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"닦다","audio":"/audio/ba0c254ce311d46f6118.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60316","senseId":"2","lemma":"닦다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"닦고","audio":"/audio/8c4022eac64e691be5d0.mp3"}},{"text":"자요?","meaning":"睡，睡觉","explanation":"자다：睡，睡觉；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"자다","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69511","senseId":"1","lemma":"자다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자요","audio":"/audio/06bda50561159508e850.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3