3"}},{"text":"해야지.","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어야지：表达应当如此、决心或提醒，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해야지","audio":"/audio/9b9ddd99ded43e842a80.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"023aa5fb34178979","term":"자다","zh":"睡，睡觉","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3","entryId":"69511","definition":"闭眼睛，停止身体、精神活动，一时进入休息状态。","pronunciation":["자다"]},{"id":"d9f427c3257e81e0","term":"전","zh":"上","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3","entryId":"17306","definition":"时间上之前的。","pronunciation":["전"]},{"id":"0efb3081ed85ab14","term":"당연히","zh":"当然","audio":"/audio/0efb3081ed85ab147e84.mp3","entryId":"49497","definition":"按道理应当是那样。","pronunciation":["당연히"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c8339738a6ca959ecf77.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.038,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=49497","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":64,"sequenceScore":1.5515,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["当然要啊，睡前必须做这个。","承奎已经回家了吗？","妈妈，今天也要刷牙再睡觉吗？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["当然要啊，睡前必须做这个。","妈妈，今天也要刷牙再睡觉吗？","承奎已经回家了吗？"],"answer":0}]}
